    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοικτ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιῶ</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			903
		</span></i>: = foreg., c. acc. rei, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					384
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λακὶς χιτῶνος
			ἔργον</span> (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτῶνα</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> οὐ
			κατοικτιεῖ</span> A.l.c.:—
				Med.
			, <i>bewail oneself, utter lamentations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.121
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́</span>, <i><span class="en">
				3.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
