				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>:—aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῳκτίσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					686
				</span></i>
			: c.acc., as in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόν</span>”
